    "description": "### Impact\r\nThe vulnerability is an Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR) that allows any authenticated user to access metadata about AI personas, features, and LLM models by providing their identifiers. This information includes credit allocations and usage statistics which are not intended to be public. The attack is performed over the network, requires low privileges (any logged-in user), and results in a low impact on confidentiality with no impact on integrity or availability.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nDisable AI plugin or upgrade to a patched version.",
